  "content": "Cancer Free Since 2009 – Featured Healing StoryRadical Remission ProjectJun 19, 20141 min readUpdated: Nov 9, 2023Tamara St. John is a Radical Remission survivor of Stage 4 breast cancer. Diagnosed at age 40, she made the personal decision not to use conventional medicine, but rather to first try healing her cancer using other methods. Today, she currently has no evidence of cancer.Here is her story, in her own words:I had breast cancer in 2009 and healed it without surgery, chemotherapy, or radiation. I used only proper nutrition and detoxification in proper order. I used a combination of the Budwig protocol, apricot kernels, juicing, enzyme therapy, exercise, dry heat sauna, and prayer. I conducted a lot of research and personal experimentation and put it all into a book to make it easier for others to heal their own cancer naturally. You can find more info and the book at www.Tamarastjohn.com.You can purchase her book on Amazon here.[In terms of what may cause cancer, I believe that] cancer is caused from a nutritional deficiency that starves the cells and creates tumors. The body can be starved of nutrition due to candida overgrowth and/or parasites. What caused my cancer was candida overgrowth and parasites created by years of bad diet, smoking, and alcohol.Did you know that The Radical Remission Project puts out a monthly newsletter with even more stories of healing as well as upcoming events and the latest news?! Sign up HERE!Finally, feel free to leave a COMMENT below. We love hearing from you!306306 views00 commentsPost not marked as liked",
